# Line endings are normalised to LF for all text files.
#
# WHY THIS MATTERS HERE: check_baseline_integrity.py verifies 87 framework files by
# SHA-256. Those hashes were computed on LF content. Without this file, Windows Git
# converts LF to CRLF on checkout, the bytes differ, and the check FAILS locally while
# PASSING in CI (which runs Linux). That is precisely the local/CI divergence Step 94
# exists to prevent.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
